# Layer 8 MayPlay$ (StaticAbilityContinuous.java RULES layer, Card.setMayPlay):
# Crucible of Worlds grants "you may play lands from your graveyard". The
# grant is rebuilt on every state-based-action check the turn walk runs, and
# PlayLand takes the Forest from the graveyard (without it the play is
# declined and the Forest stays put). It still counts as the land drop.
startturn human
advance 3
playland human 2
